window.products.push({"id":1171097,"name":"ecohero Real Coconut Shell Bowls Set of 2 Bio Coco Woody Utensils|2 Spoons + 2 Forks + Jute Sponge| Smoothie Bowls and Spoons, Coconut bowls for Smoot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71udzeaTdkL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"EcoHero Natural Real Coconut Shell Bowls Twin coast coconut bowl are completely natural, toxin-free, synthetic free, plastic free, 100% natural and handmade with natural polished coconut oil. The coconut shell are cut, cleaned, sanded, and polished with organic coconut oil to become beautiful bowls. The shape of the wooden smoothie bowls does not change over time. Coconut shells are a durable material and won't break or crack. You can keep it for yourself or gift it to someone you care. Due to its unique shape, can be used as a decoration piece as well. Coconut bowls are robust and durable. Regardless of your motivation, you and our planet deserve the best. With our sustainable and products, you can be sure to get them. We genuinely believe in and are confident with our products. Our goal is to develop renewable and durable products that are a sustainable alternative to conventional products. GIFT SET CONTENTS: - Set of 2 Handmade bowls. - 2 bamboo spoons. - 2 bamboo forks. - Jute sponge made of coconut fiber. FEATURES: Organic - Vegan - Biodegradable - Compostable. WE PLEDGE 5% OF OUR PROFITS TO SUSTAINABLE ORGANIZATIONS IN INDONESIA: So support our Eco Hero movement with your order and become an Eco Hero today! We talk the talk, and we also walk the walk. Sustainability is at our core, and we strive to protect our planet as well as support social organizations and pay our producers fair wages. With the purchase of this product we donate 5% of our profits to Solemen and SAMEocean. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: Purchase Eco Hero products with confidence! We want our customers to have 100% satisfaction with every product. If your purchase has any defects, contact us, and we will issue you a replacement immediately. Thank you for choosing our product and joining the Eco Hero movement!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71udzeaTdkL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECOHERO","source_asin":"B098RBSMNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1171097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098RBSMNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098RBSMNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1171098,"name":"Bamboo Alternative Down Pillow - Adjustable Custom Fit to You - Soft Hypoallergenic Polyester - Memory Foam Liner - Machine Washable - Removable Cooli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nLDOU7gaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BAD OR NO SLEEP IS OVER! Take charge of YOUR sleep, you DESERVE a restful and happy nights sleep every night! Why Do Many People Suffer From A Bad Pillow? * Memory Foam pillows are too hard and not able to be shaped into what you need, like most companies claim they do. * Down pillows are too soft and you end up having feathers poking you all night. * Cotton pillows have no support and end up going flat within a week. What We Do To Allow You To Get The Best Sleep Of Your Life? * Blissful Serenity’s Alternative Down Pillow is made for side back and stomach sleepers and has the perfect amount of fill for a firm pillow. If you do not like a firm pillow it has a double zipper that can be opened and allows you to take out as much poly fill as you see fit to make your pillow completely customizable to YOUR personal needs. This pillow can be as thick and firm or as soft and thin as you specifically desire. A Little About The Owner * I have always suffered from not sleeping well at night and always being tired during the day. I also have been diagnosed with TMJ and always have a hard time getting my jaw comfortable. I have tried every pillow there is, but nothing was working so instead I decided to make the world’s best pillow. This pillow is 100% customizable and able to be anyone’s PERFECT pillow! Click the \"Add to Cart\" Button at the Top of This Page Now For a Better Nights Sleep Guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nLDOU7gaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blissful Serenity","source_asin":"B01K34FSPE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1171098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K34FSPE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K34FSPE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
