window.products.push({"id":1171107,"name":"GrLeaf Mattress Protector Queen 100% Waterproof Premium Mattress Pad Protector Cover Soft Breathable Bedding - Fitted 8-21 Inch Deep Pocket - Hypoalle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611GPnnqclL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"GrLeaf premium 100% waterproof mattress pad protector cover provides you with the best sleeping experience. UNIQUE DOUBLE LAYER DESIGN Ultra-thin double layer design, perfect balance of softness and waterproof，while won't affect the feel of mattress. BREATHABLE AND COMFORTABLE HNN cooling tech increase air flow and make mattress protector more breathable. Sleeping cool and comfy without changing the feeling of your mattress. SUITABLE FOR MANY PEOPLE The high-quality NBH2O technology waterproof backing protects you and your family from all troubles.Suitable for children, the elderly, pets, asthma, incontinence or female physiology and expectant mothers. PROTECT YOUR MATTRESS Keeps your mattress stain-free while effectively repel all liquids, including body fluids, sweat, urine and accidental leaks. Even protecting against dust and other allergens for the perfect night's sleep. FITTED SHEET STYLE Deep pocket, fit up to 8-21 inch. Elastic band is convenient for installing, and can automatically pull excess material under the mattress. MACHINE WASHABLE Mattress protector is machine washable, very important, which can maintain looks brand new after repetitive washing. SIZE OPTIONS ◎ TWIN: 39 x 75 + 14 inch ◎ FULL: 54 x 75 + 14 inch ◎ QUEEN: 60 x 80 + 18 inch ◎ KING: 78 x 80 + 18 inch CARE INSTRUCTIONS a. Wash cold separately and gently  b. Do not dry clean c. Do not blench d. Do not iron e. Tumble dry low f. Remove promptly WARM TIPS ▶ This mattress protector is meant to handle only small amounts of liquid that are addressed immediately ▶ Larger amounts of liquid, and liquid that is allowed to sit for more than a few hours, may eventually sleep through in the form of liquid vapor ▶ Liquids with strong odors may transfer odor to your mattress","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611GPnnqclL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GrLeaf","source_asin":"B08B7Z3PCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1171107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B7Z3PCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B7Z3PCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
