window.products.push({"id":1171374,"name":"EUNA 5 PCS Chef Knife Set Ultra Sharp Kitchen Knife Set with Sheaths and Gift Box,Premium German Stainless Steel Knives Set for Kitchen with PP Ergono","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fpYDmGsbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔪【Versatile Knife Set】The EUNA kitchen knife set is a complete package that includes 8\" chef knife, 8\" slicing knife, 7\" santoku knife, 5.5\" serrated utility knife, and 3.5\" paring knife. These multi-purpose knives can handle all your cutting needs in the kitchen, including fruit, meat, fish, tomatoes, and various vegetables. 🔪【Superb Raw Materials and Superior Sharpness】Made of high carbon forged steel with a Rockwell hardness of 53+, this cooking knife set offers exceptional toughness and durability. The cutting edge has been polished to achieve a sharpness of 13-15° per side through careful craftsmanship, while the double-sided grinding makes the blades smoother and more precise. 🔪【Distinctive Design and Appealing Aesthetics】The charming golden blade combined with the brown tree texture handle makes this 5-piece knife set uniquely beautiful. The set includes both western chef and Japanese santoku knives, making cooking a creative and enjoyable experience. 🔪【Non-Stick Coating and Ergonomic Handle】The golden coating on the EUNA kitchen knives enhances the non-stick properties, making cleaning easy and preventing corrosion and rust. The ergonomic handle design ensures a comfortable grip, even when wet. Both the coating and handle materials are non-toxic and BPA-free, ensuring safety in the kitchen. 🔪【Premium Gift Box and Exceptional Service】The EUNA knife set comes in an exquisite magnetic gift box, making it an excellent gift for family and friends who love to cook. It's a perfect gift for occasions such as birthdays, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, and Valentine's Day. All EUNA products come with a 30-day return policy and 24-hour customer service to ensure your satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fpYDmGsbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUNA","source_asin":"B0B39G2Z7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1171374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B39G2Z7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B39G2Z7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
