window.products.push({"id":1171620,"name":"Fomito EW-78D 72mm Lens Hood for Canon EF-S 18-200mm f/3.4-5.6 is, 28-200mm f/3.4-5.6 USM, 28-200mm f/3.4-5.6 Lens(for Canon EW-78D Replacement)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wXxXE62PL._AC_.jpg","description":"This EW-78D Lens Hood is designed for special lens, it can block stray light by extending and shading the end of the Canon EF-S 18-200mm f/3.4-5.6 IS, 28-200mm f/3.4-5.6 USM, 28-200mm f/3.4-5.6 Lens and prevent the lens from scratch. Also the bayonet mount design makes it firmly on your lens. Give you better photographic experiences. Suitable for: -for Canon EF-S 18-200mm f/3.4-5.6 IS -for Canon EF-S 28-200mm f/3.4-5.6 USM -for Canon EF-S 28-200mm f/3.4-5.6 Specifications: -Model:EW-78D -Color: black -Bayonet mount lens hood -Material:Plastic -Weight: 20g Features: - The addition of a lens hood can help prevent flares-those circles of light that can accompany images where a strong light source is just outside the frame. -This dedicated lens hoods is designed to match the specific focal length of the lens it was designed for. -Made of high impact plastic for an extremely solid and lightweight feel. -Lens hoods are one of the most important accessories you can purchase to improve the quality of your photos, and usually the most overlooked by beginner and amateur photographers. -Lens hoods also have the added benefit of providing extra protection to your lens from accidental bumps or scratches. -Easy to use bayonet mount attaches to your lens for a tight and secure fit. Just twist on or off. No wobbling or cross-threading. -Handy reversible design allows you to attach the hood in reverse for easy storage in your bag. Package Included: 1 x Fomito EW-78D Lens Hood for Canon 1 x Fomito Cleaning Cloth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wXxXE62PL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOMITO","source_asin":"B01HJLV3L2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1171620","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HJLV3L2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HJLV3L2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
