window.products.push({"id":1171780,"name":"Emergency Hand Crank Weather Solar Radio, radios Portable Power Bank 4000mAh Hand Crank AM FM/NOAA Radio with LED Flashlights Reading Lamp Cellphone C","category":"electronics","retail price":22.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YmCNxaiyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"📻【Hand Crank Radio】- Emergency solar powered radio comes with NOAA/SW/AM/FM, mobile power bank, LED flashlight three-speed adjustable brightness and motion sensor reading light make it a must-have for everyday life or outdoor travel. And upgraded with a headphone jack, you can connect headphones to use, convenient for your use.Compared with ordinary radios on the market, this radio has more powerful upgrade and optimization functions, which can better meet your daily outdoor needs. 🌪【High Sensitivity SW/AM/FM Radio】AM has a wider range than FM shortwave radio and keeps you up to date with the latest weather such as earthquakes, hurricanes, tornadoes and severe storms, make sure you are notified when dangerous weather is in your area. And FM can receive entertainment, sports, talk shows and news more clearly within dozens of kilometers. This emergency broadcast helped thousands of American civilians survive the season of hurricanes, tornadoes and snowstorms. 🔋【4000mAH Power Bank】: Compared with 2000mAh radios on the market, this is upgraded to a larger 4000mAh polymer battery, portable radio comes with 4 power supply methods: 3*AAA batteries, TYPE-C Fast charging, solar and hand crank. Avoid power outages due to snowstorms and keep this solar radio powered on anytime, anywhere. Fully charged, there will be up to 50 hour radio play (depending on the sound volume) or 70 hours flashlight.The crank radio also acts as a power bank to charge your phone. ★【It's The Perfect Candidate For Life】: If you are an outdoor sports enthusiast or need to walk in places without lights, this one with IPX3 water-resistant NOAA radio with super bright three-speed flashlight is a good choice. In case of emergency, you can press the \"SOS\" button, and the emergency radio will sound an alarm, so that rescuers can find it in time. Perfect for outdoor activities, travel, camping, hiking, kayaking, backpacking and other outdoor activities. ❤【Perfect All-In-One】: Emergency radios use automatic gain control (AGC) technology to change their gain based on the level of the incoming signal. So it's easier to capture the signal whether it's NOAA or FM/AM. To ensure a better experience.With Built-in Professional Speaker and upgraded telescoping antenna, emergency weather radio will dependably receive up to the emergency weather forecasts and emergency news broadcasts from NOAA and AM/FM stations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YmCNxaiyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOVOYNN","source_asin":"B09X52MNQY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1171780","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X52MNQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X52MNQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
