window.products.push({"id":1171798,"name":"Belkin Classic Tab Case for Kindle Fire HD 7\", Gravel (will only fit Kindle Fire HD 7\")","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZNXX+X7kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The sturdy exterior and soft interior lining keep your Kindle Fire HD 7\" safe from damage. The slim design enables you to slip it in and out of any bag with ease. From the Manufacturer Protect your Kindle Fire HD 7-inch with the stylish Classic Tab Cover for Kindle Fire HD 7-inch. This case features a secure magnetic tab and stretchable corners to provide a snug, secure fit for the Kindle Fire HD 7-inch. The pebble grain exterior and soft inner lining protect the screen and backing from scratches while on the go. The case's lightweight design makes it ideal for slipping into a purse or bag, so you can take your Kindle Fire HD 7-inch anywhere you go. The slim, lightweight design slips easily into any bag. View larger . The tab closure secures the cover to keep your screen protected. View larger . Secure, Stylish Protection The Belkin Classic Tab Cover provides protection with a soft interior lining and elastic corners that keep your Kindle Fire HD 7-inch securely in place. The stylish pebble grain exterior is durable, ensuring the Kindle Fire HD 7-inch's touchscreen is safe from scratches. Magnetic Tab Closure The cover features magnetic tabs to secure the Kindle Fire HD 7-inch in place. When in use, the tabs neatly hold the cover back and out of the way. Designed Specifically for the Kindle Fire HD 7-inch Belkin has designed the Classic Tab Cover specifically for the Kindle Fire HD 7-inch to provide support and lightweight, formfitting protection. Choose from Multiple Color Options The Classic Tab Cover for Kindle Fire HD 7-inch comes in gravel , pink , and purple lightning so you can customize your case to suit your personality. About Belkin International, Inc. Belkin offers a diverse product mix that provides people with seamless electronics integration in their homes, cars, and on the go. Founded in California in 1983, Belkin is a privately held company and recognized leader in connectivity solutions, in addition to accessories for smartphone and tablet devices, computers, and more. Belkin's phenomenal growth has led to an expanding global presence. In addition to corporate headquarters in Los Angeles, Belkin now has offices throughout Europe and in the Asia Pacific region, including Australia, Shanghai, and a regional headquarters in Hong Kong. What's in the Box Classic Tab Cover Classic Tab Cover for Kindle Fire HD 7-inch At a Glance: Secure, magnetized tab closure Secure, magnetized tab closure Elastic corners provide a snug fit Elastic corners provide a snug fit Pebble grain material offers durability Pebble grain material offers durability Soft liner protects touchscreen Soft liner protects touchscreen Three color options to suit your personality Three color options to suit your personality Available in multiple colors--choose your favorite. View larger .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZNXX+X7kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belkin","source_asin":"B008X9Z528","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1171798","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008X9Z528","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B008X9Z528","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
