window.products.push({"id":1171981,"name":"Teleprompter,Desview T3S Promoting for Device up to 11” with liftable Shooting Platform 70/30 Beam Splitter Glass Use via Remote or Desview APP iPad i","category":"electronics","retail price":129.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Wboy+kFEL._AC_.jpg","description":"👍【Latest Teleprompter from Desview Official】Comparing with Desview T2, the new teleprompters is designed with 2 cold shoe mounts to attach video accessories, supports larger prompting devices(up to 11”) & wider-angle lens, and comes with 4 kinds of customization ring for phone, and adjustable shade cloth for dslr to prevent light from sneaking around the lens and flaring the beamsplitter glass. 👍【70/30 Beam Splitter Glass with 26 Coated Layers】Adopting premium Beam Splitter Glass with multi-layer coating for no light loss, Desview T3S teleprompter kit gives highest definition prompting, easy to read, with zero possibility of any ghosting on glass or seeing double. 7H hardness and the lid of glass protect your teleprompters well during transport and storage. 👍【Up to 11” iPad Size Promoting Devices with 10’ Reading Distance】With the four-section retractble clamp, Desview T3S can support all ipads measuring up to 11”, similar sized tablets and all smartphones. The bigger prompting devices, the more scripts prompted in sight, the farther reading range(up to 10’) available, and the higher productivity with more ease and confidence. 👍【Retractable Base, Support Wider-Angle Lens】Desview T3S teleprompters features one easily adjustable base extending up to 40mm. Even shooting horizontally with up to 24mm lens, no vignetting or any part of the teleprompter would appear within the frame. For vertical shooting like tiktok live streaming, you also could read more lines of scrolling text reflected by your vertically placed smartphone on the clamp. 👍【Let the Script Follow Your Lead】With a Blue-tooth remote control, you could scroll through the text, and freely adjust Play/Pause, Page up/down, Slow down/Speed up simultaneously, instead of wasting time to pause the shooting and adjust your phone app setting. The free app DESTVIEW working with the remote controller is offered in app stores, compatible with all Android & iOS devices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Wboy+kFEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Desview","source_asin":"B0952X8NBY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1171981","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0952X8NBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0952X8NBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
